of this repository — rule texts, skills, references, commands, tools,
structure and naming — remain with NEO Digital.

Permitted: viewing and reading; linking to this repository at its GitHub
address; quoting individual passages to a reasonable extent with
attribution.

Not permitted without prior written consent: copying, mirroring,
downloading for redistribution or publishing the contents elsewhere, in
whole or in part; inclusion in third-party directories, catalogues,
marketplaces, collections or search services where contents of this
repository are reproduced, cached or made available; any commercial
exploitation, including sale, rental, subscription, sublicensing, bundling
with paid offerings or any other form of monetisation; modifying,
translating or creating derivative works and distributing them; use by
third parties in their own or others' productive operations; use for
training, fine-tuning or evaluating machine-learning models; use of the
names or marks "NEO", "NEO Digital", "LeoFlex" or derivations thereof,
in particular in a manner suggesting affiliation, authorship, partnership
or endorsement.

Forking within GitHub remains possible under the GitHub Terms of Service;
the restrictions above continue to apply to the contents of such a fork.

Consent under these terms requires text form. Neither a lack of response
nor the continued public availability of this repository constitutes
consent.

The contents are provided without any warranty. NEO Digital accepts no
liability for damage arising from their use.

